00:04:04.619 --> 00:04:06.037
DeSean Jackson. You know, fast–

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.789
One of the fastest guys I've seen.
- Right.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.458
- Probably fastest I've ever covered.
- Right.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.586
